# Pod runtime state — NEVER in a build context. The build context is the repo
# root, so on a pod checkout these hold live data and secrets: a `synap backup`
# tarball (with a copy of .env) was baked into three image layers on 2026-10-04.
deploy/backups
deploy/state
deploy/.env*
deploy/.secrets-backup*
**/*.dump
**/*.sql.gz
